    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Mòran taing airson pàirt a ghabhail sa phrògram Windows Insider! Feumaidh tu am PC agad a thòiseachadh às ùr ach am faigh thu Insider Preview builds.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_Flights_Dialogs_OptInConfirmHeader\Text:
