    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma bheir thu cead, is urrainn dhut taghadh dè na h-aplacaidean a gheibh smachd air rèidiothan an uidheim agad slighe nan roghainnean air an duilleag seo. Ma dhiùltas tu cothrom air, chan fhaigh aplacaidean smachd air rèidiothan an uidheim agad.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_UserGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le aplacaidean rèidiothan an uidheim a stiùireadh
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_UserGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh na h-aplacaidean a gheibh smachd air rèidiothan an uidheim agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ceadaich gum faighear smachd air na rèidiothan air an uidheam seo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma bheir thu cead, bidh cothrom aig a h-uile duine a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am faigh na h-aplacaidean aca smachd air rèidiothan an uidheim aca slighe nan roghainnean air an duilleag seo. Ma dhiùltas tu cothrom air, chan fhaigh aplacaidean smachd air rèidiothan an uidheim.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_SystemGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Inntrigeadh do dh’uidheaman-smachd rèidio
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_SystemGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faodaidh duine sam bith a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am bi smachd aig na h-aplacaidean aca air rèidiothan an uidheim ma bhios seo air
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh na h-aplacaidean a gheibh smachd air rèidiothan an uidheim agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Radios_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cleachdaidh cuid a dh'aplacaidean an rèidio – mar Bluetooth – nad uidheam gus dàta a chur 's fhaighinn. Feumaidh na h-aplacaidean seo cead na rèidiothan seo a chur air is dheth uaireannan mus obraich iad mar bu chòir.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Pictures_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ceadaich inntrigeadh le aplacaidean do leabhar-lann nan dealbhan agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Pictures_UserGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh na h-aplacaidean a gheibh cothrom air leabhar-lann nan dealbhan agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Pictures_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Inntrigeadh do leabhar-lann nan dealbhan
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Pictures_SystemGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faodaidh duine sam bith a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am bi cothrom aig na h-aplacaidean aca air leabhar-lann nan dealbhan aca ma bhios seo air
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Thoir cead do dh’aplacaidean gairmean fòn a dhèanamh no fhaighinn
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma cheadaicheas tu gairmean fòn, is urrainn dhut taghadh dè na h-aplacaidean as urrainn dhaibh gairmean fòn a dhèanamh no fhaighinn slighe nan roghainnean air an duilleag seo. Cleachdaidh Windows am fòn a cheangail thu ris a’ PC seo airson gairmean mar seo. Ma dhiùltas tu seo, chan urrainn do dh’aplacaidean gairmean fòn a dhèanamh no fhaighinn.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_UserGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le aplacaidean fòn a cur
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_UserGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh na h-aplacaidean aig am bi cead gairmean fòn a dhèanamh
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_UsageHistory_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faic na h-aplacaidean a dh’iarr cead gairm a dhèanamh sna 7 làithean seo chaidh 
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ceadaich gairmean fòn air an uidheam seo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma cheadaicheas tu gairmean fòn, bidh cothrom aig daoine a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh an urrainn dhan na h-aplacaidean aca gairmean fòn a dhèanamh no fhaighinn slighe nan roghainnean air an duilleag seo. Ma bhios an roghainn seo air, cleachdaidh Windows seirbheis mobile an fhòn a cheangail thu ris a’ PC seo airson gairmean a dhèanamh no fhaighinn (dh’fhaoidte gun iarr solaraiche na seirbheise agad cosgaisean a bharrachd ort). Ma dhiùltas tu seo, chan urrainn do dh’aplacaidean gairmean fòn a dhèanamh no fhaighinn.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_SystemGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Inntrigeadh do ghairmean fòn
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_SystemGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faodaidh duine sam bith a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am faod na h-aplacaidean aca gairmean fòn a dhèanamh ma bhios seo air
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh na h-aplacaidean aig am bi cead gairmean fòn a dhèanamh no fhaighinn
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCall_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Bidh feum aig cuid a dh’aplacaidean cead gairmean fòn a dhèanamh no fhaighinn mus obraich iad mar bu chòir. Cleachdaidh Windows am fòn a cheangail thu ris a’ PC seo airson gairmean mar seo. Ma chuireas tu dheth aplacaid an-seo, dh’fhaoidte gun cuingich seo nas urrainn dha dèanamh.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCallHistory_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le aplacaidean cothrom fhaighinn air eachdraidh nan gairmean agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCallHistory_UserGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh na h-aplacaidean aig am bi cothrom air eachdraidh nan gairmean agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCallHistory_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Inntrigeadh do dh’eachdraidh nan gairmean
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_PhoneCallHistory_SystemGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faodaidh duine sam bith a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am bi cothrom aig na h-aplacaidean aca air eachdraidh nan gairmean aca ma bhios seo air
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Notifications_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
