  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Notifications_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Inntrigeadh do bhrathan
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Notifications_SystemGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faodaidh duine sam bith a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am bi cothrom aig na h-aplacaidean aca air na brathan aca ma bhios seo air
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_MusicLibrary_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Thoir cead-inntrigidh do dh'aplacaidean do leabhar-lann a' chiùil agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_MusicLibrary_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma bheir thu cead, is urrainn dhut taghadh dè na h-aplacaidean a gheibh cothrom air leabhar-lann a’ chiùil agad slighe nan roghainnean air an duilleag seo. Ma dhiùltas tu inntrigeadh, thèid aplacaidean a tha ri fhaighinn sa Microsoft Store air Windows 11 a bhacadh o inntrigeadh do leabhar-lann a’ chiùil agad.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_MusicLibrary_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ceadaich inntrigeadh do leabhar-lannan a' chiùil air an uidheam seo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_MusicLibrary_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma bheir thu cead, bidh cothrom aig a h-uile duine a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am faigh na h-aplacaidean aca cothrom air leabhar-lann a’ chiùil aca slighe nan roghainnean air an duilleag seo. Ma dhiùltas tu inntrigeadh, thèid gach aplacaid a tha ri fhaighinn sa Microsoft Store air Windows 11 a bhacadh o inntrigeadh do leabhar-lann a’ chiùil aig duine sam bith.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_MusicLibrary_PrivacyLearnMore\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh mu roghainnean prìobhaideachd a' chiùil
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_MusicLibrary_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh na h-aplacaidean a gheibh cothrom air leabhar-lann a' chiùil agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_MusicLibrary_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha feum aig cuid a dh'aplacaidean air inntrigeadh do leabhar-lann a' chiùil agad mus obraich iad mar bu chòir. Ma chuireas tu dheth aplacaid an-seo, dh'fhaoidte gun cuingich seo nas urrainn dha dèanamh.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Motion_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le aplacaidean cothrom fhaighinn air an dàta ghluasaid agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Motion_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma bheir thu cead, is urrainn dhut taghadh dè na h-aplacaidean a gheibh cothrom air an dàta ghluasaid agad slighe nan roghainnean air an duilleag seo. Ma dhiùltas tu inntrigeadh, cha bhac sinn aplacaidean ach o inntrigeadh an dàta ghluasaid agad agus o chruinneachadh na h-eachdraidh gluasaid agad. Cha bhac seo Windows fhèin.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Motion_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ceadaich inntrigeadh do dhàta gluasaid air an uidheam seo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Motion_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma bheir thu cead, bidh cothrom aig a h-uile duine a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am faigh na h-aplacaidean aca cothrom air an dàta ghluasaid aca slighe nan roghainnean air an duilleag seo. Ma dhiùltas tu cothrom air, chan fhaigh aplacaidean cothrom air an dàta ghluasaid aig duine sam bith agus chan urrainn dhaibh eachdraidh gluasaid a chruinneachadh.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Motion_PrivacyLearnMore\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh mu roghainnean prìobhaideachd an dàta ghluasaid
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Motion_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh dè na h-aplacaidean aig a bheil cothrom air an dàta ghluasaid agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Motion_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha feum aig cuid a dh’aplacaidean air dàta gluasaid mus obraich iad mar bu chòir. Ma chuireas tu dheth aplacaid an-seo, dh’fhaoidte gun cuingich seo nas urrainn dha dèanamh.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_WindowsAndServicesGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Thoir cead-inntrigidh dhan mhicreofon agad do sheirbheisean is aplacaidean Windows
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_WindowsAndServicesGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha liosta nan seirbheisean is aplacaidean Windows a rinn inntrigeadh dhan mhicreofon agad roimhe an-seo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le aplacaidean cothrom fhaighinn air a’ mhicreofon agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma bheir thu cead, is urrainn dhut taghadh dè na h-aplacaidean a gheibh cothrom air a’ mhicreofon agad slighe nan roghainnean air an duilleag seo. Ma dhiùltas tu cothrom air, chan fhaigh aplacaidean cothrom air a’ mhicreofon agad.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_UserGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le aplacaidean cothrom fhaighinn air a’ mhicreofon agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_UserGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh na h-aplacaidean a gheibh cothrom air a’ mhicreofon agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_UsageHistory_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faic na h-aplacaidean fhuair fios air a’ mhicreofon agad sna 7 làithean seo chaidh 
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ceadaich inntrigeadh dhan mhicreofon air an uidheam seo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma bheir thu cead, bidh cothrom aig a h-uile duine a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am faigh na h-aplacaidean aca cothrom air a’ mhicreofon slighe nan roghainnean air an duilleag seo. Ma dhiùltas tu inntrigeadh, bacaidh seo gleusan Windows, aplacaidean Microsoft Store agus cuid as motha de dh’aplacaidean desktop inntrigeadh dhan mhicreofon. 
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_SystemGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Inntrigeadh dhan mhicreofon
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_SystemGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faodaidh duine sam bith a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am bi cothrom aig na h-aplacaidean aca air a’ mhicreofon ma bhios seo air
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_Spotlight_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Mhothaich Windows do chleachdadh micreofon air nach robh dùil ’s a tha feumach air d’ aire
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_PrivacyLearnMore\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh mu roghainnean prìobhaideachd a’ mhicreofon
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_MicInfo\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma tha aplacaid a’ cleachdadh a’ mhicreofon agad, chì thu ìomhaigheag mhicreofon air bàr nan saothair.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_MainHeading\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma tha aplacaid a’ cleachdadh a’ mhicreofon agad, chì thu ìomhaigheag micreofon air bàr nan saothair aig Windows.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_ClassicAppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le aplacaidean desktop cothrom fhaighinn air a’ mhicreofon agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_ClassicAppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha feum aig cuid a dh’aplacaidean agus gleusan Windows air a’ mhicreofon agad mus obraich iad mar bu chòir. Ma chuireas tu dheth an roghainn seo an-seo, dh’fhaoidte gun cuingich seo na nì aplacaidean desktop agus Windows. 
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_ClassicAppList_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le aplacaidean deasga cothrom fhaighinn air a’ mhicreofon agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_ClassicAppList_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chì thu liosta dhe na h-aplacaidean a rinn inntrigeadh dhan mhicreofon agad roimhe an-seo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh na h-aplacaidean a gheibh cothrom air a’ mhicreofon agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Microphone_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha feum aig cuid a dh’aplacaidean air a’ mhicreofon agad mus obraich iad mar bu chòir. Ma chuireas tu dheth aplacaid an-seo, dh’fhaoidte gun cuingich seo nas urrainn dha dèanamh.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le aplacaidean teachdaireachdan a leughadh
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma bheir thu cead, is urrainn dhut taghadh dè na h-aplacaidean aig am bi cead teachdaireachdan a leughadh mar SMS slighe nan roghainnean air an duilleag seo. Ma dhiùltas tu cothrom air, chan urrainn do dh’aplacaidean teachdaireachdan a leughadh.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_UserGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le aplacaidean teachdaireachdan a leughadh
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_UserGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh na h-aplacaidean aig am bi cead teachdaireachdan a leughadh
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_UsageHistory_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faic na h-aplacaidean fhuair cothrom air na SMS agad sna 7 làithean seo chaidh 
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ceadaich inntrigeadh do teachdaireachdan air an uidheam seo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma bheir thu cead, bidh cothrom aig a h-uile duine a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am faigh na h-aplacaidean aca cothrom air SMS a leughadh slighe nan roghainnean air an duilleag seo. Ma dhiùltas tu cothrom air, chan urrainn do dh’aplacaidean teachdaireachdan a leughadh.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_SystemGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Inntrigeadh do theachdaireachdan
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_SystemGlobal_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faodaidh duine sam bith a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am bi comas aig na h-aplacaidean aca teachdaireachdan teacsa a leughadh air ceangal mobile ma bhios seo air
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh na h-aplacaidean aig am bi cead teachdaireachdan a leughadh
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Messaging_AppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Bidh feum aig cuid a dh’aplacaidean cead teachdaireachd a leughadh mus obraich iad mar bu chòir. Ma chuireas tu dheth aplacaid an-seo, dh’fhaoidte gun cuingich seo nas urrainn dha dèanamh.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_WindowsAndServicesGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Thoir cead-inntrigidh dhan ionad agad do sheirbheisean is aplacaidean Windows
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_WindowsAndServicesGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha liosta nan seirbheisean is aplacaidean Windows a rinn inntrigeadh dhan ionad agad roimhe an-seo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le aplacaidean cothrom fhaighinn air d’ ionad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma cheadaicheas tu inntrigeadh, is urrainn dhut na h-aplacaidean a gheibh cothrom air ionad pongail is eachdraidh nan ionadan an uidheim agad sna roghainnean air an duilleag seo airson gleusan stèidhichte air an ionad, mar an aimsir agus stiùireadh slighe, a chur an comas. Ma chlàraich thu a-steach air cunntas Microsoft air an uidheam seo, thèid an t-ionad aithnichte mu dheireadh agad a shàbhaladh san neul agus a cho-roinneadh le uidheaman eile far an do rinn thu clàraich a-steach leis a’ chunntas Microsoft agad. Ma dhiùltas tu inntrigeadh, cha bhac sin ach na h-aplacaidean air an duilleag seo o bhith a’ faighinn cothrom air d’ ionad.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_UserGlobal2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le aplacaidean cothrom fhaighinn air d’ ionad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_UserGlobal2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gheibh gach aplacaid cothrom air d’ ionad mu thuaiream ach is urrainn dhut aplacaidean a thaghadh a gheibh cothrom air d’ ionad pongail
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_UsageHistory_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faic na h-aplacaidean fhuair fios air d’ ionad sna 7 làithean seo chaidh 
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ceadaich inntrigeadh dhan ionad air an uidheam seo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma cheadaicheas tu inntrigeadh, bheir thu cead dha Windows comasan an uidheim agad a chur gu feum airson d’ ionad fhiosrachadh agus cleachdaidh Microsoft dàta mun ionad agad airson na seirbheisean ionaid a leasachadh. Bidh cothrom aig daoine a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am faigh na h-aplacaidean aca cothrom air an ionad slighe nan roghainnean air an duilleag seo. Ma dhiùltas tu inntrigeadh, cumaidh seo Windows o bhith a’ toirt fiosrachadh mun ionad do ghleusan Windows, aplacaidean a’ Microsoft Store agus a’ chuid as motha dhe na h-aplacaidean desktop.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_TurnOffButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir dheth
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_Link\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_Dialog_Title:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir dheth seirbheisean an ionaid
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_Dialog_Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuiridh seo dheth gleus an ionaid dhan a h-uile duine a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo. Cha bhith cothrom air a’ ghleus “Lorg an t-uidheam agam” agus roinnean-tìde fèin-obrachail. Chan urrainn do dh’aplacaidean is seirbheisean an t-ionad iarraidh tuilleadh no WiFi no Bluetooth am fagas a lorg.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_CancelButtonText:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Sguir dheth
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_AdditionalDescription_On:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Bidh an t-ionad ri làimh Windows agus is urrainn do dhuine sam bith a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh dè na h-aplacaidean a gheibh cothrom air an ionad aca
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2_AdditionalDescription_Off:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha gleus an ionaid dheth agus cha bhi cothrom air an ionad aig Windows is luchd-cleachdaidh eile air an uidheam seo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Seirbheisean ionaid
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ceadaich smachd air cleachdaichean
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_SystemGlobal2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir an t-ionad air no dheth airson gach cleachdaiche air an uidheam agus air seirbheisean an t-siostaim
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_Spotlight_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Mhothaich Windows do chleachdadh ionaid air nach robh dùil ’s a tha feumach air d’ aire
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_MainHeading\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faodaidh Windows comasan an uidheim agad a chleachdadh airson fiosrachadh càit a bheil thu. Dh’fhaoidte gun cleachd Microsoft dàta mu d’ ionad pongalachd nan seirbheisean ionaid a leasachadh.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_ClassicAppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Thoir cead dhan ionad phongail agad do dh'aplacaidean desktop
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_ClassicAppList_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tha feum aig cuid a dh'aplacaidean agus gleusan Windows air d' ionad mus obraich iad mar bu chòir. Ma chuireas tu dheth an roghainn seo an-seo, dh'fhaoidte gun cuingich seo na nì aplacaidean desktop agus Windows.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_ClassicAppList_Group2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le aplacaidean deasga cothrom fhaighinn air d’ ionad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_ClassicAppList_Group2\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Chì thu liosta dhe na h-aplacaidean a rinn inntrigeadh dhan ionad agad roimhe an-seo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Location_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Gheibh gach aplacaid cothrom air d’ ionad mu thuaiream ach is urrainn dhut aplacaidean a thaghadh a gheibh cothrom air d’ ionad pongail
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_HumanPresence_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le aplacaidean gleus mothachaidh do làthaireachd a chleachdadh
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_HumanPresence_UserGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tagh na h-aplacaidean aig a bheil cead gleus mothachaidh do làthaireachd a chleachdadh
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_HumanPresence_UsageHistory_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faic na h-aplacaidean a chleachd gleus mothachaidh do làthaireachd sna 7 làithean seo chaidh 
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_HumanPresence_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cead-inntrigidh do ghleus mothachaidh do làthaireachd
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_HumanPresence_SystemGlobal_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faodaidh duine sam bith a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am bi cothrom aig na h-aplacaidean aca-sa air gleus mothachaidh na làthaireachd ma bhios seo air
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_HumanPresence_SystemGlobal_GroupSubheader\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: ’S urrainn dha Windows mothachadh dha do làthaireachd le mothaichear làthaireachd an uidheim agad agus an t-uidheam agad a dhùsgadh nuair a thig thu am fagas is an sgrìn agad a chur dheth nuair a dh’fhàgas tu e no a dhoilleireachadh.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_HumanPresence_RelatedSettings_HumanPresenceSettings\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Roghainnean gleus mothachaidh do làthaireachd
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_HumanPresence_RelatedSettings_HumanPresenceSettings\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le Windows an t-uidheam agad a ghlasadh, a dhùsgadh no a dhoilleireachadh gu fèin-obrachail.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_HumanPresence_PrivacyLearnMore\DisplayName:
