  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Gaze_UserGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Leig le aplacaidean cothrom fhaighinn air an tracaiche sùla agad
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Gaze_UserGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma bheir thu cead, is urrainn dhut taghadh dè na h-aplacaidean a gheibh cothrom air an tracaiche sùla agad slighe nan roghainnean air an duilleag seo. Ma dhiùltas tu cothrom air, cha tèid cothrom air an tracaiche sùla agad a bhacadh ach dha na h-aplacaidean. Cha bhac seo Windows fhèin.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Gaze_SystemGlobal_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ceadaich inntrigeadh dhan tracaiche sùla air an uidheam seo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Gaze_SystemGlobal_Group\Description:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma bheir thu cead, bidh cothrom aig a h-uile duine a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am faigh na h-aplacaidean aca cothrom air tracaiche na sùla slighe nan roghainnean air an duilleag seo. Ma dhiùltas tu cothrom air, chan fhaigh Windows no aplacaidean cothrom air tracaiche na sùla ach a-mhàin aplacaidean a gheibh cothrom air tracaiche na sùla slighe seirbheis eile seach an tè a tha Windows a’ solar.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Gaze_SystemGlobal\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ceadaich inntrigeadh dhan tracaiche sùla air an uidheam seo
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Gaze_SystemGlobal\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Faodaidh duine sam bith a chleachdas an t-uidheam seo co-dhùnadh am bi cothrom aig na h-aplacaidean aca ri tracaiche na sùla
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Gaze_PrivacyLearnMore\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh mu roghainnean prìobhaideachd tracaiche na sùla
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Gaze_LinkToEyeControlPage\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Roghainnean smachd-sùla
  \SystemSettings\Resources\SystemSettings_CapabilityAccess_Gaze_AppList_Group\DisplayName:
