  \SystemSettings\Resources\Holographic_Visuals_PerformanceOptimization_Description\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Bi buaidh aig roghainnean na h-àrainneachd air reandaradh aplacaidean, an raon-seallaidh is faotainneachd cuid a ghleusan ann am Windows Mixed Reality.

Ma thaghas tu piseachadh dèanadais, nì seo cinnteach gum bi rudan nas cofhurtaile, gu sònraichte air PCan aig a bheil grafaigeachd amalaichte. Ma thaghas tu a’ chàileachd lèirsinneach as fheàrr, dh’fhaoidte gum bi buaidh air dèanadas a’ PC seo.

Ma dh’atharraicheas tu an roghainn seo, dh’fhaoidte gun dèan Windows Mixed Reality ath-thòiseachadh.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\Holographic_StartupAndDesktop_AlternateHomeExperience_LearnMoreLink\Content:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Barrachd fiosrachaidh
  \SystemSettings\Resources\Holographic_StartupAndDesktop_AlternateHomeExperience_Info\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cha bhi an roghainn seo ri làimh ach ma bhios Windows Mixed Reality airson SteamVR air a stàladh is air a rèiteachadh.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\Holographic_StartupAndDesktop_AlternateHomeExperience_Info2\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cha bhi cuid a roghainnean ri làimh ach ma bhios Windows Mixed Reality airson SteamVR air a stàladh is air a rèiteachadh.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\Holographic_StartupAndDesktop_AlternateHomeExperience\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Tòisich Windows Mixed Reality airson SteamVR gu fèin-obrachail nuair a thèid am Mixed Reality Portal a chur gu dol.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\Holographic_StartupAndDesktop_AlternateHomeExperience2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Nuair a dh’fhosglas mi am Mixed Reality Portal, tòisich Windows Mixed Reality airson SteamVR gu fèin-obrachail
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_SleepTimeout_Timeout\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma tha an headset Windows Mixed Reality agad na thàmh, caidlidh an headset às dèidh:
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_SleepTimeout_TimeoutWarning\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: *Ma bhacas tu an headset on chadal às dèid còrr is leth-uair a thìde gun ghnìomhachd, dh'fhaoidte gun adhbharaich seo losgadh a-steach sgrìne.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_SleepTimeout_TimeoutWarning2\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Ma thaghas tu timeout cadail leth-uair a thìde no nas fhaide, dh’fhaoidte gun adhbharaich seo burn-in ann an uidheam-taisbeanaidh an headset agad.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_SleepTimeout_IdleAppSuspension\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir Windows Mixed Reality ’s na h-aplacaidean aige na dhàil nuair a bhios an headset agam na chadal. Dh’fhaoidte gum bi buaidh aig atharrachadh na roghainn seo air dèanadas a’ PC seo.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_SleepTimeout_IdleAppSuspension2\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir Windows Mixed Reality ’s na h-aplacaidean aige na dhàil nuair a bhios an headset agam na chadal
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_SleepTimeout_Group\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Crìoch-ùine a' chadail
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_SleepTimeout_Group\AdditionalDescription:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir an headset na chadal an dèidh dha a bhith na thàmh uiread a dh’ùine:
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_Resolution_Warning\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cha deach an headset a cheangal ris no chan eil an headset agad a’ cur taic ri sgèileadh.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_Resolution_Quality\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir dùmhlachd-bhreacaidh an taisbeanaidh air gleus
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_Resolution_LearnMoreLink\Content:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: A’ cleachdadh FAQ Windows Mixed Reality
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_Resolution_AdjustResolutionLabel\Text:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Cuir dùmhlachd-bhreacaidh an taisbeanaidh air gleus gus fìorachd mheasgaichte na dachaidh a dhèanamh cofhurtail dhut.
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_Resolution\DisplayName:
    Candidate Language=GD-GB: Dùmhlachd-bhreacaidh
  \SystemSettings\Resources\HolographicVisuals_PositionTracking_Description\DisplayName:
